{"articleNo":"503637","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=503637&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] [선발공고]2025-1학기 신입생(학부)대상 생활관생 선발 공고","writer":"생활관","writeDate":"2024.12.19","hit":"24276","attachments":[{"name":"2025-1학기 학부신입생 선발 공고문.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=503637&attachNo=139487"},{"name":"2025-1학기 학부신입생 선발 공고문.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=503637&attachNo=139488"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<pre style=\"font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; overflow: auto; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-wrap-mode: wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><p style=\"font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">학년도 1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">학기 생활관생 선발 공고를 안내합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">상세사항은 첨부파일을 반드시 읽어보시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14pt;\"><font face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">※&nbsp;</font><font face=\"함초롬바탕\">신입생은 원서 제출 시 생활관 사용여부를 신청합니다.</font></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14pt;\"><font face=\"함초롬바탕\">생활관 사용 여부 확인 및 원서수정은 입학처(054-478-7900)으로 문의하시기 바랍니다.</font></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><br></p><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; border-style: double; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(254, 137, 67); background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-wrap: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 14pt;\">[결핵진단서 제출방법]</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">\n가. 제출기간: 2025. 2. 17.(월) 10:00 ~ 2. 21.(금) 18:00\n      ※ 사전 미제출 시 현장에서 서류 제출 가능, 미제출시 입실 불가</span></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">나. 제출방법: </span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; text-wrap-mode: wrap; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">통합 정보시스템 내 제출, 자세한 경로 추후 공지 예정</span></p></div><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><br></span></font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"></p><pre style=\"font-size: 14px; overflow: auto; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.62rem;\"><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; border-style: double; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(121, 165, 228); background-color: rgb(219, 232, 251);\"><p style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-wrap: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">주요 참고사항</span></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">1.</span><a href=\"https://dorm.kumoh.ac.kr/dorm/sub0401.do?mode=view&amp;articleNo=422765&amp;article.offset=0&amp;articleLimit=10&amp;srSearchVal=%EC%8B%9D%EC%82%AC%EB%B3%80%EA%B2%BD&amp;srSearchKey=article_title\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\" style=\"color: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"> </span></a><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><a href=\"https://dorm.kumoh.ac.kr/dorm/sub0401.do?mode=view&amp;articleNo=422765&amp;article.offset=0&amp;articleLimit=10&amp;srSearchVal=%EC%8B%9D%EC%82%AC%EB%B3%80%EA%B2%BD&amp;srSearchKey=article_title\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\" style=\"color: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">식사변경 안내</span></span></a></span></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-wrap: wrap;\">생활관 홈페이지 내 공지사항 - '식사변경'검색 - 추후 공지될 \"2025학년도 1학기 식사변경 안내\"공지문 참고</span></font></p><div style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-wrap: wrap;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><br></span></font></div><div style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-wrap: wrap;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2. </span><a href=\"https://dorm.kumoh.ac.kr/dorm/sub020102.do\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\" style=\"color: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">생활관 시설관련 안내</span></span></a></font><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">(아래 주소 복사하여 주소창에 붙여넣기)</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-wrap: wrap;\">https://dorm.kumoh.ac.kr/dorm/sub020105.do</span><span style=\"font-size: 24px; text-wrap: wrap;\"><br></span></font></div><div style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-wrap: wrap;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></font></div><div style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-wrap: wrap;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">3. <span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">입사 전 제출서류 정정(입사 전 추후 공지 예정인 <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">입사안내문</span> 꼭 필독)</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">-<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">검사일</span>이 <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">2025</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">. 1. 1.이후</span>인 <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">결핵</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">진단서만 인정</span></span></font></div><div style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-wrap: wrap;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">- 추후 통합 정보시스템 내 제출 경로 공지 예정</font></div></div></pre><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></span></p><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; border-style: double; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(159, 211, 49); background-color: rgb(231, 253, 181);\"><p style=\"font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); word-break: break-all; text-wrap: nowrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; font-size: 24pt; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">FAQ</span><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); word-break: break-all; text-wrap: nowrap;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-wrap: wrap;\">\n</span></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-wrap: nowrap;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap; font-size: 14pt;\">  Q. </span><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">생활관 신청은 어떻게 하나요?</span></font><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\"><br></span></font></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-wrap: nowrap;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap;\">     ☞ 신입생은 원서 제출 시 생활관 사용을 신청하였습니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-wrap: nowrap;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap;\">         신청 확인 여부는 <span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">입학처(054-478-7900)</span>로 전화하셔서</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-wrap: nowrap;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap;\">         \"2025년 신입생입니다. </span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-wrap: nowrap;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap;\">         원서 내 생활관 사용 신청 여부 확인하고 싶습니다.\"하시면</span><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-wrap: nowrap;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap;\">         생활관을 신청했는지 안했다면 어떻게 원서를 수정할 수 있는지 안내해주실 것입니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-wrap: nowrap;\"><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-wrap: nowrap;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap; font-size: 14pt;\">  Q. </span><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">신입생은 어느 생활관에 배정되나요?</span><br></span></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-wrap: nowrap;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap;\">     ☞ 신입생은 생활관이 랜덤으로 배정되므로 1인실 또는 2인실, 푸름관 또는 오름관 일반실에 배정됩니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-wrap: nowrap;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  Q. 2학기 생활관도 자동 신청되나요?</span>\n     ☞ 1학기만 원서 내 생활관 사용 체크 시 자동 신청 및 랜덤 배정되므로</span></font></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-wrap: nowrap;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">          1학년 하계방학, 2학기, 겨울방학은 추후 학생이 직접 지망 순으로 관을 선택, 신청해야합니다. \n\n</span></font></font><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap; font-size: 14pt;\">  Q</span><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">. 공고문에 나온 납부기간에 납부하지 못했습니다. 생활관 사용이 불가능한가요?</span>\n     ☞ 납부기간에 미납하시면 자동 탈락됩니다. 추후 1학기 추가선발 공고를 참고하시어 </span></font></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-wrap: nowrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 1rem;\">         신청기간 내 신청하실 수 있습니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-wrap: nowrap;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">\n</span></font></font><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap; font-size: 14pt;\">  Q</span><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">. 선발 결과, 납부계좌는 언제 확인할 수 있나요?</span>\n</span></font><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap;\">     </span><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">☞ 합격하신 모집에 따라 결과발표 및 납부기간이 다르며 납부기간 시작일부터 정보 확인이 가능합니다.\n         </span></font><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">예) 수시~정시최초 합격자는 2025. 2. 17.(월) 10시부터 합격 관 및 생활관비 확인 가능</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">\n</span></font><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  Q</span><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">. 담당자 전화번호가 어떻게 되나요?</span>\n</span></font><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">     </span><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">☞ (입학원서 내)생활관 신청 여부 문의: 054-478-7900</span></span></font><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">     </span><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">☞ 전반적인 선발 문의: 054-478-7943\n     ☞ 생활관비 문의: 푸름관비: 7201, 오름관비 7947(오름관2·3동 공공요금 예치금 포함)\n</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">     ☞ 푸름관·아름관 시설(공사, 고장 포함) 문의: 7946\n     ☞ 오름관 시설(공사, 고장 포함) 문의(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">각 관 운영사): 오름관1동(070-8786-5001), 오름관2동(070-7209-6070), </span></span></font><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">오름관3동(070-7198-1650)</span></p></div><p style=\"font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><br><a href=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&amp;articleNo=445761&amp;article.offset=0&amp;articleLimit=10&amp;srSearchVal=%EC%8B%A0%EC%9E%85%EC%83%9D&amp;srSearchKey=article_title\" class=\"line\" style=\"color: inherit; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: left; display: inline !important;\"></a></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><br></p></pre>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
